      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The clinical features of two siblings with both hereditary sensory neuropathy and bilateral tonic pupils are described. Other neurologic disorders associated with tonic pupils are reviewed. Our patients appear to represent a unique instance of the association of disorders that primarily affect the ciliary and dorsal root ganglia."},
